<title>USA: DBA Systems Inc Q3 March 31 net increases.</title>
<headline>DBA Systems Inc Q3 March 31 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE, Fla. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				    March 31	    March 31</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues	 $6,381,000 $5,418,000 $18,105,000 $14,914,000</p>
<p> Net Income	  704,000    272,000   1,399,000     746,000</p>
<p>Earnings per Share</p>
<p>   Primary		 .16	  .06	   .31	   .17</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted	 .16	  .06	   .31	   .17</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the third quarter of 1997 included $175,000 realized from the settlement of a 1987 lawsuit.</p>
</text>
